## Cross-service integration

| Integration | Detail |
|-------------|--------|
| Email handoff | Auth-code redirect unchanged; sync role **before** redirect with session body |
| Identity profile | Pass `core_nav` matching session role via `toCoreNavQueryValue` |
| JWT | Local verify only; no Identity per-request calls |

