## Risks and open items

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| User with super_admin row always synced as super_admin (pre-1.9.4) | Frontend always sends session body; validate server-side |
| Multi-company users | Use primary company from existing `getMyCompany` rule |
| Strict AC: dialog always when in company | Spec allows skip when only one assumable role — document in finish report |

